(2.1 Compatibility and Crossmatching) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 666 Td
(Pre-transfusion testing ensures complete immunological compatibility between donor and recipient.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 648 Td
(ABO blood group system antibodies \(anti-A and anti-B\) are naturally occurring IgM antibodies.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 630 Td
(An acute hemolytic transfusion reaction can occur with as little as 10 to 15 mL of ABO-incompatible red cells.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 612 Td
(Immediate signs include fever, chills, hemoglobinuria, dyspnea, hypotension, and acute renal failure.) Tj
