ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 570 Td
(Whole blood and packed red blood cells are stored at 1 to 6 degrees Celsius in regulated preservation solutions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 552 Td
(CPDA-1 anticoagulated blood has a licensed shelf-life of 35 days, whereas additive solutions extend to 42 days.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 534 Td
(Storage lesion changes include progressive decline in 2,3-DPG, intracellular potassium leakage, and microparticles.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.22 0.26 0.32 rg
40 516 Td
(Stringent quality controls mandate 24-hour post-transfusion in vivo erythrocyte survival greater than 75%.) Tj
